leOfStockAxis_us-gaap_IPOMember_q2d4pPvZrEmBZQ6aZWjeOA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_pfXOo8LEgEWs8n9VlmbKUA">4.00</ix:nonFraction> per share, and the Company&#8217;s Class A ordinary shares started to trade on the Nasdaq Capital Market under the ticker symbol &#8220;YSXT&#8221; since December 18, 2024. On the closing date of the IPO, the underwriters exercised its over-allotment option to purchase an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_qbTeu3n2yEmrQO6IuoS81Q" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2024_To_12_19_2024_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_PVrDmvfjJ0uMUDilHvP1tw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_jK-mqaPED0aVIV4Fcm7N5A">187,500</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares, par value US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_ue62wJF5HUyYPBS2QRX0YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_19_2024_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_pGJM6oWGDEmeDITg4w2JDA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_5RPy0CEeVka0OqyiSeNerQ">0.0001</ix:nonFraction> per share at the price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_ue62wJF5HUyYPBS2QRX0YQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_19_2024_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_pGJM6oWGDEmeDITg4w2JDA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_IwGJTd_1VkaeT9qMg_hCHA">4.00</ix:nonFraction> per share. Gross proceeds of the Company&#8217;s IPO, including the proceeds from the sale of the over-allotment shares, totaled $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_yovK8iPZ_EedJPURUVJWjg" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2024_To_12_19_2024_12wJsg3Qo0-K4-Spml7F4w" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" scale="6" id="Narr_x6Ut9dPxRUChA6bg-f5cWQ">5.75</ix:nonFraction> million, before deducting underwriting discounts and other related expenses, resulting in net proceeds of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_yovK8iPZ_EedJPURUVJWjg" contextRef="Duration_12_19_2024_To_12_19_2024_12wJsg3Qo0-K4-Spml7F4w" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedOnTransaction" scale="6" id="Narr_w8MHbh07WkWQS9osdSPpzg">5.0</ix:nonFraction> million.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On April 21, 2025, Beijing Yi Chen Ma Tian International Holding Co., Ltd. (&#8220;Yi Chen Ma Tian&#8221;) was formed as a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_rrae3UlHvU-oC0aCapvvoQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_21_2025_dei_LegalEntityAxis_YSXT_YsxHkHoldingCoLimitedMember_srt_OwnershipAxis_YSXT_BeijingYiChenMaTianInternationalHoldingCoLtdMember_mCVyLiKyAkWkx-wntT6DWw" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" id="Narr_D8LVRIIkrkyuHaj9LPU5BQ">100</ix:nonFraction>% controlled subsidiary of YSX HK. Yi Chen Ma Tian did not have active business operations as of March 31, 2026 and as of the date of this report, and solely acts as a holding company. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On September 28, 2025, Anjielun was deregistered with the PRC State Administration for Industry and Commerce (&#8220;SAIC&#8221;) due to immaterial business activities since its inception.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 